  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "dsh-air",
      "text": "中文 | [English](README.en.md)\n\n`dsh-air` 支持使用 `↑` / `↓` 切换历史发送记录，并通过 `/btw` 打开停靠式侧边对话。"
    },
    {
      "section": "安装",
      "text": "```bash\ndsh plugin --profile web add dsh-air\n```\n\n安装后重新启动 DSH。"
    },
    {
      "section": "卸载",
      "text": "```bash\ndsh plugin --profile web remove dsh-air\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "快捷键",
      "text": "| 快捷键 | 功能 |\n| --- | --- |\n| `↑` | 输入框为空时召回上一条发送记录。 |\n| `↓` | 切换到更新的历史记录。 |\n| `Ctrl+R` | 搜索历史发送记录。 |\n| `Enter` | 接受当前历史搜索结果。 |\n| `Esc` | 取消历史搜索并恢复原草稿。 |\n| `/btw [问题]` | 打开侧边对话；`/side` 是等价别名。 |"
    },
    {
      "section": "设置与本地数据",
      "text": "设置页的「AIR 插件」区可以查看已保存的历史消息数量、调整历史上限，并清除 dsh-air 保存的历史、富草稿和大段粘贴数据。历史上限默认为 500 条，可设置为 10–5000 条；清除数据时会保留上限设置。\n\n历史、草稿和粘贴引用保存在当前浏览器的 `localStorage` 中。清除站点数据也会移除这些记录。\n\nBTW 面板的左侧边缘可以拖拽调整宽度。聚焦调整手柄后，`←` / `→` 每次调整 24 像素，按住 `Shift` 每次调整 80 像素，`Home` / `End` 跳到最小 / 最大宽度；调整结果会保存到本地。"
    },
    {
      "section": "License",
      "text": "[MIT](LICENSE)"
    },
    {
      "section": "dsh-air",
      "text": "[中文](README.md) | English\n\n`dsh-air` lets you browse previously sent prompts with `ArrowUp` / `ArrowDown` and open a docked side conversation with `/btw`."
    },
    {
      "section": "Install",
      "text": "```bash\ndsh plugin --profile web add dsh-air\n```\n\nRestart DSH after installation."
    },
    {
      "section": "Uninstall",
      "text": "```bash\ndsh plugin --profile web remove dsh-air\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "Shortcuts",
      "text": "| Shortcut | Action |\n| --- | --- |\n| `ArrowUp` | Recall the previous sent prompt from an empty composer. |\n| `ArrowDown` | Move to a newer history entry. |\n| `Ctrl+R` | Search sent prompt history. |\n| `Enter` | Accept the current history search result. |\n| `Esc` | Cancel history search and restore the original draft. |\n| `/btw [question]` | Open a side conversation; `/side` is an alias. |"
    },
    {
      "section": "Settings and local data",
      "text": "The **AIR 插件** section in DSH settings shows the saved history count, lets you change the history cap, and can clear dsh-air's stored history, rich drafts, and large-paste payloads. The cap defaults to 500 entries and accepts 10–5,000; clearing data keeps the cap setting.\n\nHistory, drafts, and paste references are stored in the current browser's `localStorage`. Clearing the site's browser data removes these records as well."
    },
    {
      "section": "Settings and local data",
      "text": "Drag the left edge of the BTW panel to resize it. When the resize handle is focused, `←` / `→` change the width by 24 pixels, `Shift` plus an arrow changes it by 80 pixels, and `Home` / `End` jump to the minimum / maximum width. The chosen width is persisted locally."
    },
    {
      "section": "License",
      "text": "[MIT](LICENSE)"
    }
  ],
